FerrionOS change to Redox base (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 20f7573b4dc011ea5267189185edc0b2f12bab0f with ferrion-boot-splash.patch and ferrion-lockdown.patch applied:
- ptyd counts a PTY's open subterminal handles. Once a subterminal was opened and the last one closes, the master is hung up: it reports a read event and, after the buffered output, reads end of file;
- getty hands its subterminal handles to login without keeping copies, and waits for login once the master reads end of file, so the login prompt comes back after a logout without polling.

